1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
This is Atlas.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:08,000
The work queue brings invoice exceptions
that need review into one place.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:14,000
INV-4821 from Kigali Metals is matched
to PO-2291 and its delivery record.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,000
100 steel rods are invoiced.
GRN-882 records 80 received.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,000
A 20-unit gap and 4% price variance
exceed the 2% tolerance.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:34,000
The demo agent proposes a payment hold
and a corrected invoice.

7
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Policy blocks payment until the quantity
mismatch is resolved.

8
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:47,000
A document request is ready for review.
Outbound actions are simulated.

9
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:55,000
The timeline links the recommendation,
policy result, and action to the invoice.

10
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Kubernetes for Enterprise Reality
